{
  "id": "6aa6ad5bff09cbdd1552acbd",
  "title": "見積もりを立てにくい問題から取り組む",
  "created": 1789308251,
  "updated": 1789308297,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5bff09cbdd1552acbd",
      "text": "見積もりを立てにくい問題から取り組む",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be957b",
      "text": "from [2022/12/05]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be957d",
      "text": "あるタスクが出たとき、[細部]が気になって結局締め切りギリギリになったり[竜頭蛇尾]の構成になったりするのありがち[cFQ2f7LRuLYP.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308258
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be957e",
      "text": "　[見積もり能力]があんまり良くない",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be957f",
      "text": "　　この辺の話題、[エンジニアリング組織論への招待]でも出てきたな。読み直そう",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be9580",
      "text": "　　わかるので気になる[yosider.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be9581",
      "text": "  [不確実性]についての話 p.36~38[cFQ2f7LRuLYP.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be9582",
      "text": "   [見積もり]を立てにくい",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be9583",
      "text": "    やったことがない、初めて取り組む問題",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be9584",
      "text": "     やり方もかかる時間もわからない",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be9585",
      "text": "    [不確実性]が高い",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be9586",
      "text": "    例：ボルシチを作るのにかかる時間",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be9587",
      "text": "   見積もりを立てやすい",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be9588",
      "text": "    既にやったことがある問題",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be9589",
      "text": "     どのくらいで終わるか、どうしたら終わるかがわかっている",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be958a",
      "text": "    [不確実性]が低い",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be958b",
      "text": "    例：味噌汁を作るのにかかる時間",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be958c",
      "text": "   あるタスクに対して問題を切り分けたとき",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be958d",
      "text": "    見積もりを立てにくい問題から取り組むと、あとに残るのは不確実性の低い問題",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be958e",
      "text": "     進むに連れてスケジュールの完了の見通しが高くなる",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be958f",
      "text": "    見積もりを立てやすい問題から取り組むと、あとに残るのは不確実性の高い問題",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be9590",
      "text": "     最後の方でも「どうやろう、何をすればいいんだろう」となるので予測が立てにくくなる",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be9591",
      "text": "   [自分の能力、タスクの難易度を正しく見積もる]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be9592",
      "text": " [エンジニアの知的生産術]の第二章p.70にも「見積り能力を鍛える」の項があった",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad5b0000000000be9593",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308251,
      "updated": 1789308251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad820000000000be9594",
      "text": "[あいまいで大きなタスク]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308290,
      "updated": 1789308297
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa6ad830000000000be9595",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789308291,
      "updated": 1789308291
    }
  ]
}